{
  "judges.15.p1.b1": {
    "text": "日がたって後、麦刈の時にサムソンは子やぎを携えて妻をおとずれ、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 15:1"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.15.p1.b2": {
    "text": "へやにはいって、妻に会いましょう",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 15:1"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.15.p1.b3": {
    "text": "妻の父ははいることを許さなかった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 15:1"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.15.p1.b4": {
    "text": "あなたが確かに彼女をきらったに相違ないと思ったので、わたしは彼女をあなたの客であった者にやりました。彼女の妹は彼女よりもきれいではありませんか。どうぞ、彼女の代りに妹をめとってください",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 15:2"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.15.p1.b5": {
    "text": "今度はわたしがペリシテびとに害を加えても、彼らのことでは、わたしに罪がない",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 15:3"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.15.p2.b1": {
    "text": "そこでサムソンは行って、きつね三百匹を捕え、たいまつをとり、尾と尾をあわせて、その二つの尾の間に一つのたいまつを結びつけ、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 15:4"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.15.p2.b2": {
    "text": "たいまつに火をつけて、そのきつねをペリシテびとのまだ刈らない麦の中に放し入れ、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 15:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.15.p2.b3": {
    "text": "そのたばね積んだものと、まだ刈らないものとを焼き、オリブ畑をも焼いた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 15:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.15.p3.b1": {
    "text": "これはだれのしわざか",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 15:6"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.15.p3.b2": {
    "text": "テムナびとの婿サムソンだ。そのしゅうとがサムソンの妻を取り返して、その客であった者に与えたからだ",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 15:6"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.15.p3.b3": {
    "text": "そこでペリシテびとは上ってきて彼女とその父の家を火で焼き払った。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 15:6"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.15.p3.b4": {
    "text": "あなたがたがそんなことをするならば、わたしはあなたがたに仕返しせずにはおかない",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 15:7"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.15.p3.b5": {
    "text": "そしてサムソンは彼らを、さんざんに撃って大ぜい殺した。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 15:8"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.15.p3.b6": {
    "text": "こうしてサムソンは下って行って、エタムの岩の裂け目に住んでいた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 15:8"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.15.p4.b1": {
    "text": "そこでペリシテびとは上ってきて、ユダに陣を取り、レヒを攻めたので、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 15:9"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.15.p4.b2": {
    "text": "そこでユダの人々三千人がエタムの岩の裂け目に下って行って、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 15:11"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.15.p4.b3": {
    "text": "ペリシテびとはわれわれの支配者であることをあなたは知らないのですか。あなたはどうしてわれわれにこんな事をしたのですか",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 15:11"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.15.p4.b4": {
    "text": "彼らがわたしにしたように、わたしは彼らにしたのです",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 15:11"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.15.p4.b5": {
    "text": "あなたがた自身はわたしを撃たないということを誓いなさい",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 15:12"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.15.p4.b6": {
    "text": "彼らは二本の新しい綱をもって彼を縛って、岩からひきあげた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 15:13"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.15.p5.b1": {
    "text": "サムソンがレヒにきたとき、ペリシテびとは声をあげて、彼に近づいた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 15:14"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.15.p5.b2": {
    "text": "その時、主の霊が激しく彼に臨んだので、彼の腕にかかっていた綱は火に焼けた亜麻のようになって、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 15:14"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.15.p5.b3": {
    "text": "そのなわめが手から解けて落ちた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 15:14"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.15.p5.b4": {
    "text": "彼はろばの新しいあご骨一つを見つけたので、手を伸べて取り、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 15:15"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.15.p5.b5": {
    "text": "それをもって一千人を打ち殺した。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 15:15"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.15.p6.b1": {
    "text": "ろばのあご骨をもって山また山を築き、ろばのあご骨をもって一千人を打ち殺した",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 15:16"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.15.p6.b2": {
    "text": "彼は言い終ると、その手からあご骨を投げすてた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 15:17"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.15.p6.b3": {
    "text": "これがためにその所は「あご骨の丘」と呼ばれた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 15:17"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.15.p7.b1": {
    "text": "時に彼はひどくかわきを覚えたので、主に呼ばわって言った、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 15:18"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.15.p7.b2": {
    "text": "あなたはしもべの手をもって、この大きな救を施されたのに、わたしは今、かわいて死に、割礼をうけないものの手に陥ろうとしています",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 15:18"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.15.p7.b3": {
    "text": "そこで神はレヒにあるくぼんだ所を裂かれたので、そこから水が流れ出た。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 15:19"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.15.p7.b4": {
    "text": "サムソンがそれを飲むと彼の霊はもとにかえって元気づいた。それでその名を「呼ばわった者の泉」と呼んだ。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 15:19"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "judges.15.p7.b5": {
    "text": "サムソンはペリシテびとの時代に二十年の間イスラエルをさばいた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Judges 15:20"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  }
}
